ssed through the graft are eligible.\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"OR\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"The target vessel is in a 'last remaining' epicardial vessel (e.g. greater than 2 non-target epicardial vessels and the bypass grafts to these territories [if present] are totally occluded).\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}" 

