bicuspid aortic valve are not excluded providing they have no other exclusion criteria;\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Patients with a primary diagnosis of severe acute pancreatitis, without reference to a Ranson score [Ranson 1974]). However, patients with mild or moderate pancreatitis are not excluded;\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Patients with percutaneous gastric or jejunal feeding tubes already in situ as per Health Canada guidance;\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"Strict contraindication or inability to receive enteral medications;\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"OR\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"Intent to withdraw advanced life support as per the ICU physician;\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"OR\": {\n                                    \"left\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"Previous enrolment in this or current enrolment in a potentially confounding trial;\"\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}" 

