otal weekly IgPro20 dose of = 50 mL (= 10 g).\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"AND\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"Experience with pump-assisted infusions of IgPro20 at tolerated volumes of 25 mL/injection site for at least 1 month prior to Day 1.\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"AND\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"Experience with frequent (2-7 times per week) infusions of IgPro20 at the tolerated flow rate of approximately 0.5 mL/min (equivalent of 25-30 mL/h) per injection site for at least 1 month prior to Day 1.\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"AND\": {\n                                    \"left\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"The dose (volume) per injection site should not exceed 25 mL.\"\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}" 

